        "description": {
            "value": "<p>The well goes down further than it did. Your maximum reiatsu pool increases to <strong>2</strong> Reiatsu Points.</p><hr /><p><em>How this works in Foundry: Pathfinder derives your focus pool's size from the focus effects you know &mdash; one point per non-cantrip focus effect &mdash; and then clamps it to a ceiling. This feature sets that ceiling. Until you have chosen a Spirit and gained its Release Technique, you know no focus effects and the pool reads 0, which is correct rather than broken.</em></p>"
